# Only applies to CLI deploys (`vercel deploy`), which upload the working
# directory — anything not listed here is sent, tracked by git or not.
#
# Deploys run from git now, and a git deploy builds from the repository clone
# and ignores this file entirely. It is kept for the occasional CLI deploy from
# a laptop, where it is still what keeps node_modules and the build artefacts
# out of the upload.
node_modules
.next
.git
.DS_Store
*.tsbuildinfo

# Screen recordings kept alongside the project, not part of the site. Anchored
# to the root so the mosaic's own clips in public/images are untouched.
/Microsoft Edge.mp4
/Microsoft Edge2.mp4
